5 Summary of Deliverables & Output Packages
When a document extraction process is finalized, DataForge produces four interconnected assets
designed for immediate use by analysts, data scientists, and policy auditors.
• Clean Dataset (dataset.csv / .xlsx / .json) — Formatted, verified, and structured
data ready for import into analytical tools (Stata, R, Python, SQL).
• Data Dictionary (data_dictionary.csv) — A metadata file defining original headers,
normalized column names, data types, primary keys, and description rules.
• Provenance Trail (provenance.csv) — An audit ledger mapping every record back to
its source document ID, exact page number, and the extraction model used.
• Extraction Manifest (extraction_manifest.json) — A cryptographic summary containing SHA-256 file hashes, timestamps, prompt version numbers, and configuration parameters
to ensure scientific reproducibility.
